{"id":"n37043-1-15","stage":2,"title":"집어넣다 · 放进去","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37043-1-15-1","ko":"책을 왜 가방에 집어넣지 않고 팔에 들고 다니니?","zh":"为什么书不放包里，要拿在胳膊上走呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책을","audio":"/audio/e44a325e9f08fbcedc00.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"가방에","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방에","audio":"/audio/fb3696def9a429e4fa7d.mp3"}},{"text":"집어넣지","meaning":"放进去","explanation":"집어넣다：放进去；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"집어넣다","audio":"/audio/c293eabecc993d83b4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37043","senseId":"1","lemma":"집어넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집어넣지","audio":"/audio/586e38a8d5357a675a88.mp3"}},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않고","audio":"/audio/0a35d31b8ad5abd7d1f4.mp3"}},{"text":"팔에","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔에","audio":"/audio/8e3aa3c2f8a993023289.mp3"}},{"text":"들고","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들고","audio":"/audio/3d6ddd0808b42a3e0c7e.mp3"}},{"text":"다니니?","meaning":"走动、到处走（带着书）","explanation":"들고 다니다 指把东西带在身边走动；本句问为什么将书拿在胳膊上，不是经常去某个固定地方。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니니","audio":"/audio/b4796ede12feb3e1f05b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"c293eabecc993d83","term":"집어넣다","zh":"放进去","audio":"/audio/c293eabecc993d83b4da.mp3","entryId":"37043","definition":"使进入某个空间、团体或范围之内。","pronunciation":["지버너타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"走动、到处走","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"走动、到处走","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3795a380f7bfbeadc18.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37043-1-15-2","ko":"그냥 귀찮아서.","zh":"就是嫌麻烦而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"只是、没别的原因","explanation":"그냥 귀찮아서：只是因为觉得麻烦，没有其他特别的原因；不是随便做某个动作。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"귀찮아서.","meaning":"麻烦，厌烦","explanation":"귀찮다：麻烦，厌烦；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"귀찮다","audio":"/audio/133acb4be52ff131970f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37050","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀찮아서","audio":"/audio/40245e4b775be89362b6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"没有别的想法或特别理由","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有别的想法或特别理由","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"133acb4be52ff131","term":"귀찮다","zh":"麻烦，厌烦","audio":"/audio/133acb4be52ff131970f.mp3","entryId":"37050","definition":"不喜欢，讨厌。","pronunciation":["귀찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/662441c961e9bec81ddd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37043","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是嫌麻烦而已。","唉，房东突然要涨房租了。","为什么书不放包里，要拿在胳膊上走呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就是嫌麻烦而已。","为什么书不放包里，要拿在胳膊上走呢？","唉，房东突然要涨房租了。"],"answer":0}]}
